      "length": 1,
      "text": " "
    },
    {
      "type": "len_string",
      "start": 3726,
      "end": 4013,
      "length": 285,
      "text": "    The 3050 Record Sheet book does not show ferro-fibrous armor crits, even though the 3050 Technical Readout for the 200-D had FF and FF is required for the mass to come out right. Therefore, FF crits are shown in this design. Their locations is not critical for gameplay, of course."
    },
